### 4.1. Dicionário de Estrutura Relacional

- **`tenants`**: `id` (uuid PK), `name`, `slug` (unique), `type` (school, partner, platform), `is_active`, `logo_url`, `settings` (json).
- **`users`**: `id` (uuid PK), `tenant_id` (FK nullable), `name`, `email` (unique), `password`, `role`, `activation_code` (string nullable), `activation_expires_at` (timestamp nullable), `must_change_password` (boolean default false), `email_verified_at`.
- **`profiles` / `child_profiles`**: `id` (uuid PK), `user_id` (FK nullable), `parent_id` (FK nullable), `tenant_id` (FK), `display_name`, `avatar`, `total_xp`.
- **`households` & `household_members`**: `id` (uuid PK), `family_code` (unique), `relationship` (guardian_primary, child, teen).
- **`tasks`**: `id` (uuid PK), `child_id` / `profile_id`, `creator_profile_id`, `title`, `reward_amount`, `status` (criada, notificada, em_execucao, a_validar, aprovada).
- **`classrooms`**: `id` (uuid PK), `tenant_id` (FK), `name`, `grade_level`, `teacher_id` / `teacher_profile_id`, `invite_code`.
- **`classroom_user` (Pivô Híbrido)**: `id` (uuid PK), `classroom_id` (FK), `user_id` (FK nullable para Teens), `child_profile_id` (FK nullable para Crianças), `role` (student, teacher).
- **`classroom_lessons`**: `id` (uuid PK), `classroom_id` (FK), `lesson_id` (FK), `due_date`, `priority` (low, medium, high), `assigned_at`.
- **`trails`, `lessons`, `mission_templates`**: Hierarquia pedagógica, `parent_trail_id` (versionamento imutável), `mission_template_id` (Loop 1 Obrigatório).
- **`user_progress`**: `id` (uuid PK), `user_id` / `child_profile_id`, `learning_object_id` / `lesson_id`, `status` (pending_review, validada/aprovado, rejeitado), `submission_payload`, `teacher_feedback`, `score`.
- **`partners`, `partner_programs`, `partner_challenges`**: `id` (uuid PK), `tenant_id` (FK), `budget_total`, `budget_available`, `allocated_budget`, `reward_pool`.
- **`wallets` & `ledger_entries`**: `id` (uuid PK), `walletable_id`, `walletable_type`, `balance`, `currency` (KVC / Kz), `is_frozen`. `ledger_entries` append-only com `idempotency_key` e `entry_type`.

